Context('Numeric');
$p = random(5, 20, 1);
$r = 1 - $p/100;
$expression = Formula("$r x");

######
# Body
######

BEGIN_PGML
If a pool with [`x`] gallons of water is left uncovered outside for one month with no rain, it will lose [`[$p]`] percent of its volume to evaporation. Find an expression for the number of gallons after one month.

[_]{$expression}{20}

END_PGML

